# Talisman then goes to Bot2 (the lone opponent, so nobody is asked) with two counters. "Activate only during your
# turn": on Bot1's next turn Bot2 controls it and is refused, though Bot1 could use it on their own turn above.

[Bot1 Deck]
Wishclaw Talisman
Island x3
Mox Jet
Island x2
Island x2
Sol Ring
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x17

